@base = http://localhost:5199
# Fill these from GET /api/products and from the order responses
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Catalog: list (cached 30 s, 5 calls per 10 s)
GET {{base}}/api/products

### Catalog: get one (cached 60 s; 2nd call shows "Cache hit" in the console)
GET {{base}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### Catalog: create (FluentValidation -> 400 with field codes when invalid)
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "USB-C hub", "sku": "HUB-007", "price": 149.9, "stock": 12 }

### Catalog: invalid product, answered in Portuguese
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR

{ "name": "", "sku": "", "price": 0, "stock": -1 }

### Catalog: change price (evicts the product caches)
PUT {{base}}/api/products/{{productId}}/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newPrice": 199.9 }

### Orders: place (send twice with the same key: same order, no duplicate)
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-001

{ "customerEmail": "ana@example.com", "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Orders: get
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Orders: pay (retry + circuit breaker around the payment gateway)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay

### Orders: cancel (409 if already paid)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Simulation: payment gateway fails the next 2 calls (retry absorbs it)
PUT {{base}}/api/simulation/payment-gateway?mode=Flaky&failures=2

### Simulation: payment gateway down (circuit opens after a few failed payments)
PUT {{base}}/api/simulation/payment-gateway?mode=Down

### Simulation: payment gateway healthy again
PUT {{base}}/api/simulation/payment-gateway?mode=Healthy

### Reports: sales report
GET {{base}}/api/reports/sales

### Reports: too slow -> 504 after 3 s (in Portuguese)
GET {{base}}/api/reports/sales?simulatedDelayMs=5000
Accept-Language: pt-BR
